/*
  PDFRender - module glue: init/final, SWI dispatch and *Commands.

  SWI interface (chunk base is a PLACEHOLDER, see cmhg/modhead):
    PDFRender_Open      R1 -> ctrl-terminated filename
                        => R0 = document handle, R1 = page count
    PDFRender_Close     R0 = handle
    PDFRender_Info      R0 = handle
                        => R0 = pages, R1 = (major<<8)|minor
    PDFRender_PageSize  R0 = handle, R1 = page (1-based)
                        => R0 = width mpt, R1 = height mpt, R2 = rot
    PDFRender_Render    R0 = flags (bit 0: white background)
                        R1 = handle, R2 = page (1-based)
                        R3 = sprite area ptr, R4 = sprite ptr
                        (page is scaled to fit the sprite)

  Copyright (c) RISC OS Technologies 2026.
  SPDX-License-Identifier: CDDL-1.0
  Licensed under the Common Development and Distribution License 1.0; see LICENSE.
*/

